{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the twisted depths of the\u00a0Virexon Pharmaceuticals research facility, where failed experiments roam and dark secrets lurk behind every locked door.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664400/extras/Gif4.gif?t=1744698288\" /><br>Face relentless hordes of the undead, terrifying bosses, and cryptic puzzles standing between you and freedom. Survive the nightmare alone or team up with up to 3 friends in intense online co-op. Will you uncover the truth or become part of the experiment?<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664400/extras/Gif2.gif?t=1744698288\" /><br><br>This demo features a large section of the Virexon\u00a0Pharmaceuticals research facility for you to explore. <br>Your main goal is to escape and this demo will require you to collect keycards and solve puzzles to reach the end. <br> <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664400/extras/Gif3.gif?t=1744698288\" /> <br> Also included in this demo is the &quot;Wave Survival&quot; mode which puts you up against an ever growing horde of zombies that spawn after each wave has been defeated, a good place to experience non-stop combat!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br>==This entire demo also has multiplayer support for both the &quot;Story&quot; and the &quot;Wave Survival&quot; modes including a save game system so you can pick up where you left off last session!== </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3664400?t=1744698288","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664400/f9d092ec469bb820d41b9f09eaf2b0f9f228c689/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744698288","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664400/3ed20e72aed5e8299c6bbd6b7ec682e646adca3f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744698288","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664400/3ed20e72aed5e8299c6bbd6b7ec682e646adca3f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744698288","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the twisted depths of the\u00a0Virexon Pharmaceuticals research facility, where failed experiments roam and dark secrets lurk behind every locked door.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664400/extras/Gif4.gif?t=1744698288\" /><br>Face relentless hordes of the undead, terrifying bosses, and cryptic puzzles standing between you and freedom. Survive the nightmare alone or team up with up to 3 friends in intense online co-op. Will you uncover the truth or become part of the experiment?<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664400/extras/Gif2.gif?t=1744698288\" /><br><br>This demo features a large section of the Virexon\u00a0Pharmaceuticals research facility for you to explore. <br>Your main goal is to escape and this demo will require you to collect keycards and solve puzzles to reach the end. <br> <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664400/extras/Gif3.gif?t=1744698288\" /> <br> Also included in this demo is the &quot;Wave Survival&quot; mode which puts you up against an ever growing horde of zombies that spawn after each wave has been defeated, a good place to experience non-stop combat!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br>==This entire demo also has multiplayer support for both the &quot;Story&quot; and the &quot;Wave Survival&quot; modes including a save game system so you can pick up where you left off last session!== </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Grossly Incandescent Games"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3656570","name":"Experiment 28"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664400/85b2a4be75029b2226391898a0008612e0da0277/header.jpg?t=1744698288","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257126103,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257126103/movie480.mp4?t=1744698287","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257126103/movie_max.mp4?t=1744698287"},"name":"Trailer 1","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257126103/50092f5d115e600ec3e978f937a083430abb81ac/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1744698287","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257126103/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1744698287","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257126103/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1744698287"}}],"name":"Experiment 28 Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Coming Soon<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Coming Soon</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Coming Soon<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Coming Soon</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Grossly Incandescent Games"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia Extrema\nDrogas l\u00edcitas","rating":"16","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"16","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Drastische Gewalt\n